Package: readmissionmultilevel
Title: How Much of Readmission Performance Belongs to the Hospital? A Mixed-Effects Study
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mayank", "Ghadia", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Multilevel (mixed-effects) models of CMS Hospital Readmissions
    Reduction Program excess readmission ratios, with conditions nested in
    hospitals nested in states.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
Imports: dplyr, ggplot2, digest, jsonlite, nlme
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
